{"seq":3,"slug":"document-deadline","title":"交单期/效期/船期等时间节点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-document-center/document-exchange/document-deadline","wordCount":1550,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"交单期-效期-船期等时间节点\">交单期/效期/船期等时间节点</h1><p>跨境贸易单证的所有错误里，最不可挽回的一类是<strong>过期</strong>。金额算错可以改单，名称漏字可以补正，但装船日一旦超过最迟装运期，无论你多努力都无法让那艘船早开一天。因此把散落在信用证条款、提单、船期表里的时间约束统一建模为一条<strong>日期链</strong>，是整个单证中心里回报最高的工程投入之一。本文讲这条链的构成、约束方向、以及如何做成可计算的校验与预警。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-日期链与约束方向\">核心概念：日期链与约束方向</h2><p>一票信用证交易的时间约束不是孤立的日期，而是一条<strong>有向链</strong>：每个日期都受上游日期的约束，并约束下游日期。把方向搞反是新手最常见的错误。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[合同签订日] --&gt; B[信用证开立日]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;最迟装运期&lt;br/&gt;Latest Shipment Date&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;实际装船日&lt;br/&gt;On Board Date&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[提单签发日]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;交单期起点&lt;br/&gt;通常=装船日&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;交单截止&lt;br/&gt;= min(装船日+交单期, 效期)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; H[&quot;信用证效期&lt;br/&gt;Expiry Date&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; I[&quot;保单日期&lt;br/&gt;不晚于装船日&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; J[银行审单 ≤5银行工作日]&#10;    J --&gt; K[&quot;付款/承兑到期日&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[合同签订日] --&gt; B[信用证开立日]\n    B --&gt; C[\"最迟装运期&lt;br/&gt;Latest Shipment Date\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"实际装船日&lt;br/&gt;On Board Date\"]\n    D --&gt; E[提单签发日]\n    E --&gt; F[\"交单期起点&lt;br/&gt;通常=装船日\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"交单截止&lt;br/&gt;= min(装船日+交单期, 效期)\"]\n    B --&gt; H[\"信用证效期&lt;br/&gt;Expiry Date\"]\n    H --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; I[\"保单日期&lt;br/&gt;不晚于装船日\"]\n    G --&gt; J[银行审单 ≤5银行工作日]\n    J --&gt; K[\"付款/承兑到期日\"]</pre><p>各节点的约束方向：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>节点</th>\n<th>约束</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最迟装运期</td>\n<td>实际装船日 ≤ 最迟装运期</td>\n<td>信用证条款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提单签发日</td>\n<td>通常 = 装船日（已装船提单）</td>\n<td>UCP 600 第 20 条</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保单日期</td>\n<td>不晚于装船日（除非信用证另有规定）</td>\n<td>UCP 600 第 28 条 e 款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>出单日</td>\n<td>各单据出单日不早于信用证开立日（部分条款要求）</td>\n<td>信用证条款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交单期</td>\n<td>装船日后 N 天内（未规定则为装船日后 21 天）</td>\n<td>UCP 600 第 14 条 c 款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>效期</td>\n<td>交单不得晚于效期</td>\n<td>信用证条款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交单截止</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min(t_{ship}+N_{present},\\ t_{expiry})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ese</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>上述两条合成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>交单期的默认值 21 天</strong>是必须记住的一条：UCP 600 第 14 条 c 款规定，若信用证未规定交单期，银行将拒绝在装运日后 <strong>21 个日历日</strong>之后提交的单据，且交单无论如何不得晚于效期。注意是**日历日（calendar days）**不是工作日，且 21 天是「装运日后」而非「提单签发日后」——虽然二者通常相同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三个易错的语义点\">三个易错的语义点</h2><p><strong>第一，「装运日」到底取哪个日期。</strong> 对已装船提单，装运日是提单上注明的 on board date；对收妥待运提单（received for shipment），若加注了 on board notation，则以该批注日期为准。多式联运单据（multimodal transport document）下，装运日是单据签发日或货物被接管（taking in charge）之日。系统里应当把「装运日」作为一个<strong>派生字段</strong>并记录其推导依据，而不是让操作员手填。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，交单期与效期的关系是「且」不是「或」。</strong> 交单必须同时满足两个上限，取较早者。很多人以为「只要在效期内就行」或「只要在交单期内就行」，都错。若信用证效期早于装船日 + 21 天，则效期是更紧的约束。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，银行工作日的边界。</strong> 五个银行工作日的审单时限用的是<strong>银行工作日（banking days）</strong>，排除周末与银行假日；而 21 天交单期用的是<strong>日历日</strong>。混用这两种计时单位是常见缺陷。此外，若交单截止日恰逢银行非营业日，可以顺延到下一个营业日（UCP 600 第 29 条 a 款），但这一顺延<strong>不适用于最迟装运期</strong>——装运期是不可顺延的硬日期。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>计时单位</th>\n<th>用于</th>\n<th>可否顺延</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>日历日</td>\n<td>交单期（21 天等）、效期</td>\n<td>效期遇非营业日可顺延（UCP 29a）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>银行工作日</td>\n<td>审单时限（5 日）、付款处理</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬日期</td>\n<td>最迟装运期</td>\n<td><strong>否，不可顺延</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"建模-把日期链做成可计算的类型\">建模：把日期链做成可计算的类型</h2><p>工程上正确的做法是把日期链表达为一组<strong>带类型的约束</strong>，每条约束有起点、偏移、单位、参考依据，然后用一个求解/校验步骤检查是否全部满足。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type TimeUnit = &#39;CALENDAR_DAY&#39; | &#39;BANKING_DAY&#39; | &#39;MONTH&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface DateConstraint {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  target: DateField;&#10;  base: DateField | &#39;FIXED&#39;;&#10;  offset: number;&#10;  unit: TimeUnit;&#10;  kind: &#39;LATEST&#39; | &#39;EARLIEST&#39; | &#39;EXACT&#39;;&#10;  source: &#39;LC_TERMS&#39; | &#39;UCP600&#39; | &#39;CONTRACT&#39;;&#10;  ucpRef?: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;type DateField =&#10;  | &#39;LC_ISSUE_DATE&#39;&#10;  | &#39;LATEST_SHIPMENT_DATE&#39;&#10;  | &#39;ACTUAL_ON_BOARD_DATE&#39;&#10;  | &#39;BL_ISSUE_DATE&#39;&#10;  | &#39;INSURANCE_DATE&#39;&#10;  | &#39;PRESENTATION_DATE&#39;&#10;  | &#39;LC_EXPIRY_DATE&#39;&#10;  | &#39;PAYMENT_DUE_DATE&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TimeUnit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CALENDAR_DAY'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'BANKING_DAY'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'MONTH'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DateConstraint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  target</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DateField</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  base</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DateField</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'FIXED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  offset</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  unit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TimeUnit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'LATEST'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'EARLIEST'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'EXACT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  source</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'LC_TERMS'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'UCP600'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CONTRACT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  ucpRef</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DateField</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'LC_ISSUE_DATE'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'LATEST_SHIPMENT_DATE'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ACTUAL_ON_BOARD_DATE'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'BL_ISSUE_DATE'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'INSURANCE_DATE'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PRESENTATION_DATE'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'LC_EXPIRY_DATE'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PAYMENT_DUE_DATE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>有了这组约束，校验就变成一个纯粹的求解问题：给定实际日期值，逐条检查约束是否满足，输出违例及其依据条款。这直接喂给 <a href=\"../letter-of-credit/document-compliance-check\">单证严格相符审单</a> 的日期链规则组。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function evaluateDateChain(&#10;  actuals: Partial&lt;Record&lt;DateField, Date&gt;&gt;,&#10;  constraints: DateConstraint[],&#10;  calendar: BankingCalendar,&#10;): DateViolation[] {&#10;  const violations: DateViolation[] = [];&#10;  for (const c of constraints) {&#10;    const target = actuals[c.target];&#10;    const base = c.base === &#39;FIXED&#39; ? null : actuals[c.base];&#10;    if (!target || (c.base !== &#39;FIXED&#39; &amp;&amp; !base)) continue;&#10;    const limit = addOffset(base ?? null, c.offset, c.unit, calendar);&#10;    if (c.kind === &#39;LATEST&#39; &amp;&amp; target &gt; limit) {&#10;      violations.push({ constraintId: c.id, ucpRef: c.ucpRef, target, limit });&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;  return violations;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> evaluateDateChain</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  actuals</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Partial</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">DateField</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  constraints</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DateConstraint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  calendar</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BankingCalendar</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DateViolation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> violations</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DateViolation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> constraints) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> target</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actuals[c.target];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> base</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'FIXED'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actuals[c.base];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">target </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (c.base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'FIXED'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">base)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">continue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> limit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> addOffset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, c.offset, c.unit, calendar);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (c.kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'LATEST'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> limit) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      violations.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ constraintId: c.id, ucpRef: c.ucpRef, target, limit });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> violations;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"预警-把校验提前到交单之前\">预警：把校验提前到交单之前</h2><p>日期链的价值不只在「事后判对错」，更在于<strong>事前预警（early warning）</strong>。三类预警最有价值：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>最迟装运期临近</strong>：在装船日临近信用证最迟装运期时提前提醒订舱与船期，避免装上一条会超期的船。</li>\n<li><strong>交单期余额不足</strong>：交单期是倒计时，一旦制单延迟就压缩议付时间。应在剩余天数低于阈值（如 7 天）时预警。</li>\n<li><strong>效期与交单期冲突</strong>：若计算发现效期早于「装船日 + 交单期」，说明这条信用证本身很紧，应在<strong>开证阶段</strong>（收到 MT700 时）就提示受益人，而不是等交单时才发现。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>第三类尤其重要——它把风险前移到最有可能解决的时点。信用证条款是可以要求修改（MT707）的，但修改必须在问题发生<strong>之前</strong>提出才有意义。系统应在收到信用证时立即算出这条链的所有关键日期与冲突点，产出「信用证到期日、最迟装运期、交单截止日」三张工作倒排表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>时间约束是一条有向链，方向是：开证日 → 最迟装运期 → 装船日 → 交单截止（受交单期与效期双重约束，取较早者）。</li>\n<li>三个易错点：装运日的取法按提单类型而变；交单期与效期是「且」关系；日历日与银行工作日不可混用，最迟装运期不可顺延。</li>\n<li>工程上把日期链建模为带单位与依据的约束集合，校验成为可计算的求解问题，直接喂给审单引擎。</li>\n<li>日期链的最高价值是事前预警，尤其应在收到信用证时就检测「效期早于装船日+交单期」这类结构性冲突。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>至此单证如何生成、审单、流转已成闭环；剩下的问题是它可能被伪造或被外部规则拦截，请读 <a href=\"../trade-doc-risk/doc-fraud-prevention\">伪造单证识别与核验</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"交单期/效期/船期等时间节点","id":"交单期-效期-船期等时间节点"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：日期链与约束方向","id":"核心概念-日期链与约束方向"},{"level":2,"text":"三个易错的语义点","id":"三个易错的语义点"},{"level":2,"text":"建模：把日期链做成可计算的类型","id":"建模-把日期链做成可计算的类型"},{"level":2,"text":"预警：把校验提前到交单之前","id":"预警-把校验提前到交单之前"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"电子提单(eBL)平台与流转","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-document-center/document-exchange/electronic-bol-platform"},"next":{"title":"伪造单证识别与核验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-document-center/trade-doc-risk/doc-fraud-prevention"}}